# Binary/artifact hydration rules.
#
# Git LFS ADOPTED (2026-11): models/ weights (*.pt, *.pkl) are stored in
# Git LFS (ROADMAP artifact-migration item). Requirements:
#   - a clone that touches models/ must register the LFS filters ONCE per
#     clone (`git lfs install --local`, already present in .git/config) —
#     unregistered clones check out pointer stubs instead of weights.
#   - CI/CodeQL do NOT fetch LFS objects: tests build synthetic fixtures
#     and никогда read real model/data files, so checkout stays lfs:false.
# `data/stomar.db` and *.parquet stay regular blobs (small; synced with
# plain git). `-text` keeps git from line-ending-renormalizing binaries.
*.pt filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.pkl filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.parquet -text
*.db -text
